  ($q$Physics$q$, 1, $q$A body is projected vertically upward with a velocity of 20 m s⁻¹. Taking the acceleration due to gravity as 10 m s⁻², its displacement after 3 seconds is$q$, $q$15 m upward$q$, $q$15 m downward$q$, $q$5 m upward$q$, $q$5 m downward$q$, 'A', $q$s = ut − ½gt² = 20(3) − ½(10)(3²) = 60 − 45 = 15 m, upward.$q$),
